    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this 4 bedroom detached dormer bungalow to the market for sale. \n\nThis attractive four bedroom detached dormer bungalow is ideally situated in the popular Ballintine Park development in Allen. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation and provides an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable family home in a peaceful residential setting.\n\nInternally, the property has been freshly painted throughout and benefits from newly laid carpets, creating a bright and welcoming feel. The accommodation offers four good sized bedrooms along with generous living and kitchen areas, making it well suited to a variety of buyers.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a private rear garden, which requires some tidying and landscaping work but offers excellent potential to create an attractive outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nWith its spacious accommodation, fresh interior finish and scope to further enhance the rear garden, this property presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a detached home in Ballintine Park, Allen.\n\nViewing is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Carpet flooring, recessed spot lights, alarm point \n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled flooring, recessed spot lights, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, Belfast kitchen sink, double oven, hob, extractor fan, doorway access to utility room, hardwood French doors giving access to rear garden\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, fully fitted storage units, stainless steel sink, doorway access to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Carpet flooring, recessed spot lights, feature fireplace with wrought iron insert and polished hearth \n\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor to ceiling, corner shower unit, WHB, WC, heated towel rail \n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring, fully fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 4 (Downstairs): Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe \n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor to ceiling, corner shower unit, WHB, WC, heated towel rail \n\nBathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, bath, WHB, WC, heated towel rail \n\nFeatures:\n\nWired for alarm\nHardwood front door\nAttic access\nPVC double glazed windows\nPatio area to rear\nGarden shed\nNot overlooked\nMains water\nMains sewage\nOil fired central heating\nBuilt in 2005\nc.187.55sqmt \n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
